{"sections":[{"slug":"凝聚层的导出范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"凝聚层的导出范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层的导出范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"凝聚层的导出范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">向量丛不能做同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为向量丛的范畴不是</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">例如向量丛的态射的核不一定是向量丛</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复流形上的向量丛相当于局部自由凝聚层</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">可以做同调</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是同调代数的合适的语言</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $D^b(X):= D^b(\\mathsf{Coh}(X))$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上凝聚层的有界</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于两个</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $X,Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">若存在</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性的三角范畴等价</span> $D^b(X)\\simeq D^b(Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $X$, $Y$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/导出等价","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出等价</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于缺少内射对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">需要考虑更大的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf {Qcoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的导出范畴</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Noether概形","text":"Noether <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">后者有足够多内射对象</span>.)</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $*=+,-,b$, $D^*(\\mathsf {Qcoh}(X)) \\simeq D^*_{\\mathsf {Qcoh}}(\\mathcal O_X\\mathsf {-Mod})$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中后者表示</span> $D^*(\\mathcal O_X\\mathsf {-Mod})$ <span lang=\"zh\">中具有拟凝聚同调的</span> $\\mathcal O_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">模复形的子范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">不可分解性</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/三角范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">三角范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">可分解</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指存在两个非空的子三角范畴</span> $D_1,D_2$, <span lang=\"zh\">互相没有非零态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的元素</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">总可放进特殊三角</span> $A\\to C\\to B\\to A[1]$, $A\\in D_1,B\\in D_2$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. $D^b(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">不可分解当且仅当</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">引理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal F^\\bullet\\in D^b(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\operatorname{supp}\\mathcal F^\\bullet:= \\bigcup_i \\operatorname{supp}(\\mathcal H^i(\\mathcal F^\\bullet))$ (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/支集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">支集</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">等于两个不交闭集</span> $Z_1,Z_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的并</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathcal F^\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">可写为</span> $\\mathcal F_1^\\bullet \\oplus \\mathcal F_2^\\bullet$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\operatorname{supp}(\\mathcal F_i^\\bullet) = Z_i$. (<span lang=\"zh\">类似于环的中心幂等元分解</span>.)</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">重构</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由导出范畴与自等价群可重构出代数簇本身</span> (Bondal, Orlov).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $\\omega_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">丰沛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">这可以推出</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">一般类型</span>”, general type) <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $\\omega_X^{-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">丰沛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Fano簇","text":"Fano <span lang=\"zh\">簇</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $D^b_{\\mathsf {coh}}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可重构</span> $X$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}